    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Regular Pinball Game is a punishing pinball climbing game where you only control mechanical elements placed in the level. <br> <br>Test your patience as you guide the ball to the top in this minimalist two-button game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to smash your screen\u2014the meta narration might just cheer you up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429020/extras/985c1bf1887477a23336c9c557867b33.poster.avif?t=1748778879\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429020/extras/985c1bf1887477a23336c9c557867b33.webm?t=1748778879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429020/extras/985c1bf1887477a23336c9c557867b33.mp4?t=1748778879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Climb your way up in the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429020/extras/3e5705725c7cbd87d57d230ff54fff2e.poster.avif?t=1748778879\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429020/extras/3e5705725c7cbd87d57d230ff54fff2e.webm?t=1748778879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429020/extras/3e5705725c7cbd87d57d230ff54fff2e.mp4?t=1748778879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Speed-run support and Steam achievements are part of the journey.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Regular Pinball Game is a punishing pinball climbing game where you only control mechanical elements placed in the level. <br> <br>Test your patience as you guide the ball to the top in this minimalist two-button game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to smash your screen\u2014the meta narration might just cheer you up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429020/extras/985c1bf1887477a23336c9c557867b33.poster.avif?t=1748778879\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429020/extras/985c1bf1887477a23336c9c557867b33.webm?t=1748778879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429020/extras/985c1bf1887477a23336c9c557867b33.mp4?t=1748778879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Climb your way up in the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429020/extras/3e5705725c7cbd87d57d230ff54fff2e.poster.avif?t=1748778879\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429020/extras/3e5705725c7cbd87d57d230ff54fff2e.webm?t=1748778879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429020/extras/3e5705725c7cbd87d57d230ff54fff2e.mp4?t=1748778879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Speed-run support and Steam achievements are part of the journey.</p>",
